ion": "This service explainer video presents a pharma company’s offerings through multiple digital actors, ensuring clarity and consistency across all communication. Clean, contextual visuals support the explanations, making complex information easy to understand. \n\nThe entire video is produced using an advanced AI video pipeline, enabling fast turnaround, cost efficiency, and high production quality.\n\nThe entire video is produced without any physical shoot, powered by high-end GPU computers using CGI, VFX, and AI to create polished, visually rich explainer videos without studios or live production.\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films, Static Images To Video & Social Media Videos. Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for Youtube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 210, "view_count": 66, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w-xZVWLQrvg", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": ["AI ad film", "AI commercial", "AI generated video", "AI video production", "generative AI advertising", "CGI commercial", "CGI ad film", "VFX commercial", "VFX ad film", "virtual production ad", "no shoot advertisement", "virtual ad film", "digital advertising", "future of advertising", "AI marketing video", "brand film", "product ad video", "3D commercial", "synthetic media", "creative technology", "AI content creation", "next gen advertising", "AI powered ads", "virtual filmmaking", "AI visual effects"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=w-xZVWLQrvg&ei=zCdWaorTG92Ov_IPxYO-2Q4&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1784056380&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=F0E38E8B6AE6A536E53A25EF6B5BC623B642D254.D6D8448FC005A8C3316824AD6863C17E60C86D9B&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=en&fmt=json3", "name": "English (Original)", "impersonate": true}, {"ext": "srv1", "url": "https://www.yout